Gurudev Sri Sri Ravi Shankar is a global humanitarian, peacemaker and spiritual leader known for founding “The Art of Living”.&amp;nbsp;

Gurudev joins Theo to talk about gaining a reputation as a child prodigy, how he helped end a war in Columbia, and real ways meditation can improve our lives.

Gurudev Sri Sri Ravi Shankar: https://www.instagram.com/gurudev/&amp;nbsp;

